  "description": "<ul><li><strong>Effect: Declare before rolling, and take Disadvantage on the attack roll to aim for a specific location. Only one arrow a round can be a called shot, and its save is against your Class Save DC.</strong></li><li><strong>Head: </strong>Fortitude save or stunned 1 round. A creature that saves against, or recovers from, your Head shot is immune to your Head shots for 1 minute</li><li><strong>Arm: </strong>Fortitude save or drops what's held</li><li><strong>Leg: </strong>Fortitude save or movement halved 1 round</li><li>From 10th level: no longer requires disadvantage.</li></ul>",
